@base = http://localhost:8080
# Sustituir el valor por base64 de usuario:contraseÃ±a para el cliente REST utilizado.
@authorization = Basic REEMPLAZAR_BASE64
@sessionId = REEMPLAZAR_UUID

### Salud (sin autenticaciÃ³n)
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Crear sesiÃ³n completa
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./sesion-completa.json

### Crear borrador
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sessions
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./borrador.json

### Consultar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Editar observaciones (usar la version de la Ãºltima consulta)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/observations
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":0,"observations":"Mejor recuperaciÃ³n al final de la sesiÃ³n."}

### Historial
GET {{base}}/api/v1/athletes/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/sessions?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### Agenda del entrenador (team=true para equipo)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/agenda?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&team=false
Authorization: {{authorization}}
